## Interface: 16001
## Title: Top Ramen ThunderCats
## Notes: /trtc opens the ThunderCats window. When you cast Shifting Power it plays a ThunderCats clip: shuffle between the clips you tick, or always play the one you pick. Play buttons let you hear each clip first, and a volume slider sets how loud they are. Sometimes stay quiet skips some casts so it doesn't get overdone.
